**Estimated time**: 2 hours
**Depends on**: T01 (i18n), T02 (barrel), T13 (cache helpers — or create stub and wire later)
**Requirements**: REQ-PERM-004, REQ-REV-001 through REQ-REV-003, AC-22 through AC-24, AC-62

### Subtasks

